{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.046243035270127186,"w":0.1185745112101237,"x":0.089256433590944387,"h":0.016525557330835605,"t":"Audioscripts","c":1},{"w":0.10291262308756509,"c":1,"y":0.094392523209526957,"t":"PART 4","x":0.091262135128277869,"h":0.016199376947040434},{"t":"Good morning. Now, we've been asked to choose an aspect of European clothing or fashion","w":0.72646052042643228,"h":0.019064681626554503,"y":0.12026225096739585,"c":1,"x":0.0930854538490299},{"w":0.34788841247558588,"y":0.13912354423392737,"x":0.091081466432346145,"t":"and to talk about its development over time.","h":0.017184706120476179,"c":1},{"h":0.020481563579999085,"y":0.16108411394644162,"x":0.0891813542006481,"c":1,"t":"I decided to focus on a rather small area of clothing and that's pockets. I chose pockets for","w":0.71873794555664061},{"h":0.019170449753045271,"c":1,"t":"two reasons, really. We all have them - in jeans, jackets, coats, for example - and even","y":0.17806512492700388,"x":0.091137644493841874,"w":0.69345631917317707},{"c":1,"x":0.089217327721609077,"w":0.74198165893554691,"h":0.019907454018280868,"t":"though we often carry bags or briefcases as well, nothing is quite as convenient as being able","y":0.19432647331188191},{"w":0.72845733642578125,"h":0.020260812634619652,"y":0.20983674959882848,"t":"to pop your phone or credit card into your pocket. Yet, I suspect that, other than that, people","c":1,"x":0.089157746904408267},{"h":0.021295320504922333,"c":1,"x":0.091106040552899406,"t":"don't really think about pockets too much and they're rather overlooked as a fashion item.","w":0.70904067993164066,"y":0.22592621096857701},{"w":0.72660207112630215,"y":0.24932050982214315,"t":"It's certainly very interesting to go back in time and see how pockets developed for men and","x":0.091080006341553499,"h":0.0218402494151273,"c":1},{"w":0.70323150634765619,"y":0.26672901977088326,"c":1,"x":0.091113752710851939,"t":"women. In the 18th century, fashions were quite different from the way they are now, and","h":0.020622539817358398},{"h":0.020052425586545963,"c":1,"y":0.28235195219336684,"x":0.091098229680473819,"w":0.73816223144531246,"t":"pockets were too. If we think about male fashion first... that was the time when suits became"},{"c":1,"t":"popular. Trousers were knee-length only and referred to as 'breeches, the waistcoats were","w":0.71859115600585932,"y":0.29874104306113891,"h":0.019603927113185482,"x":0.091184847323905943},{"w":0.72653233846028642,"h":0.021449111035308333,"c":1,"t":"short and the jackets were long, but all three garments were lined with material and pockets","x":0.091111667402880792,"y":0.314790704579195},{"w":0.73425120035807301,"y":0.33135572574314143,"t":"were sewn into this cloth by whichever tailor the customer used. The wearer could then carry","x":0.091119428196635585,"h":0.019078221425089081,"c":1},{"h":0.022509942693502483,"x":0.091091445835729132,"t":"small objects such as pencils or coins on their person and reach them through a gap in the","y":0.34639167386731939,"w":0.71687281290690108,"c":1},{"h":0.020732511241116525,"t":"lining. Coat pockets became increasingly decorative on the outside for men who wanted","y":0.36331015871097994,"w":0.69546361287434899,"x":0.091129445935440381,"c":1},{"t":"to look stylish, but they were often larger but plainer if the wearer was someone with a","x":0.091086792181112722,"h":0.021874959595106769,"c":1,"y":0.378723837887463,"w":0.68763376871744797},{"t":"profession who needed to carry medical instruments - a doctor or physician, for example.","x":0.093007509888007767,"y":0.39552455035556344,"c":1,"w":0.70711613972981768,"h":0.02024413492077981},{"x":0.093069033514585731,"y":0.44382995756637689,"w":0.73618840535481767,"h":0.020430410985263325,"t":"The development of women's pockets was a little different. For one thing, they weren't nearly","c":1},{"x":0.093029917344150212,"t":"as visible or as easy to reach as men's. In the 18th and 19th centuries, women carried","y":0.45991243804572091,"w":0.68188669840494787,"h":0.020915445583260306,"c":1},{"x":0.093053734606300134,"t":"numerous possessions on their person and some of these could be worth a lot of money.","y":0.4760529629550514,"h":0.020273256153332531,"c":1,"w":0.70125239054361976},{"x":0.093071707749534202,"y":0.49259612712277034,"w":0.71677602132161455,"c":1,"h":0.019764470014245306,"t":"Women were more vulnerable to theft and wealthy women, in particular, worried constantly"},{"c":1,"t":"about pickpockets. So - what they did was to have a pair of pockets made that were tied","w":0.70135518391927076,"h":0.022348759256047956,"x":0.092991606666147766,"y":0.50732721387599933},{"h":0.022887161587628935,"t":"together with string. The pockets were made of fabric, which might be recycled cloth if the","c":1,"x":0.093001680518766061,"y":0.52437578742000746,"w":0.70912638346354173},{"w":0.70914326985677079,"x":0.094949373635354273,"h":0.023787730802256712,"y":0.54006827899514553,"c":1,"t":"wearer had little money or something more expensive, such as linen, sometimes featuring"},{"y":0.55762924425240668,"x":0.093060558189707668,"c":1,"t":"very delicate embroidery. Women tied the pockets around their waist so that they hung","w":0.68570292154947909,"h":0.019654178916479581},{"t":"beneath their clothes. Remember, skirts were long then and there was plenty of room to hide","c":1,"x":0.094980204337724486,"y":0.57313127389383833,"w":0.73239069620768227,"h":0.022240514547282708},{"x":0.095001222519609699,"w":0.70512573242187493,"t":"a whole range of small possessions between the layers of petticoats that were commonly","y":0.59001022064225983,"h":0.020407439615124812,"c":1},{"x":0.094984316152400369,"t":"worn. They would have an opening in the folds of their skirts through which they could reach","w":0.72846476236979174,"h":0.020183268514377684,"y":0.60566477723787437,"c":1},{"h":0.020173860116168396,"c":1,"y":0.62293532449736566,"t":"whatever they needed, like their perfume. Working women, of course, also needed to carry","x":0.094991017004512346,"w":0.7168147277832031},{"c":1,"x":0.094977105508650184,"w":0.7071512858072917,"y":0.63820828585204048,"t":"around items that they might use for whatever job or trade they were involved in, but their","h":0.022796502514420336},{"c":1,"y":0.65517921241741139,"t":"pairs of pockets still remained on the inside of their clothing, they just got bigger or longer -","x":0.095033043162869521,"w":0.72254730224609376,"h":0.02012853176794327},{"c":1,"x":0.096966053258832549,"w":0.32649937947591146,"h":0.016108008411443109,"y":0.67393859380121501,"t":"sometimes reaching down to their knees!"},{"t":"So the tie-on pockets went well into the 19th century and only changed when fashion altered","h":0.020348346270504747,"w":0.73040318806966142,"x":0.096944155391414877,"c":1,"y":0.69556570127862127},{"t":"towards the end of that period. That's when dresses became tighter and less bulky, and","y":0.71213132722946948,"h":0.019442339626799532,"x":0.095008502665836922,"w":0.69348281860351557,"c":1},{"y":0.72782657115167038,"h":0.019683272222120851,"x":0.095021082291037451,"c":1,"t":"the pairs of pockets became very noticeable - they stood out too much and detracted from","w":0.71871470133463544},{"h":0.022041881715768596,"y":0.74351299714348829,"x":0.094984376047424532,"t":"the woman's image. Women who had been used to carrying around a range of personal","c":1,"w":0.69745783487955737},{"y":0.76074834287232385,"t":"possessions - and still wanted to - needed somewhere to carry these items about their","w":0.68958724975585939,"h":0.018678170795381255,"c":1,"x":0.098901154853071674},{"c":1,"w":0.72846099853515622,"x":0.096905984294157477,"t":"person. That was when small bags, or pouches as they were known, came into fashion and,","y":0.77508135127580446,"h":0.022852349207037381},{"c":1,"t":"of course, they inevitably led on to the handbag of more modern times, particularly when","w":0.69928288777669279,"y":0.79283679166916987,"h":0.020171016324717739,"x":0.096966972704813081},{"x":0.0990291208759876,"t":"fashion removed pockets altogether.","c":1,"y":0.81246105909777711,"w":0.28932039896647138,"h":0.013120336324626392},{"w":0.038834950129191095,"c":1,"y":0.96220930256351767,"t":"108","x":0.099029126824195277,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q32","y":0.26598837235427752,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"x":0.8563106802244177},{"y":0.31395348853074823,"t":"Q33","w":0.036893202463785801,"x":0.85631068045742764,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883112922392,"c":1,"y":0.37790697686650399,"t":"Q34","x":0.85631068053995174,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"t":"Q35","y":0.4433139533669872,"x":0.85631068023583978,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"y":0.50872093011331077,"t":"Q36","x":0.85631068017812295,"h":0.01308139551465759,"w":0.038834950129191026,"c":1},{"x":0.85825242774522736,"w":0.038834950129191026,"y":0.55668604677288225,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"Q37","c":1},{"w":0.038834950129191026,"t":"Q38","y":0.60610465104354327,"c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.85825242775093846},{"c":1,"w":0.042718445460001697,"x":0.86019417521902819,"y":0.71075581382969899,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q39"},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q40","c":1,"y":0.79215116266931263,"x":0.86213592283885243,"w":0.040776697794596362}],"h":3209}